Warning [L0201]: implicit clone of `x`; this value is borrowed, so it is copied into the JSON value
  --> tests/ui_lint/json_text_view_clone.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     val j = JSON.Text(x);
    |                       ^
 Why: `JSON.Text` stores its own copy of this value
 Fix: write `x .clone()` to copy explicitly and silence this warning
